1
00:00:00,347 --> 00:00:03,547
(Howard:)Hey, he got her to stop.

2
00:00:03,551 --> 00:00:05,051
(Bernadette:)That was so fast.

3
00:00:05,052 --> 00:00:06,222
(Raj:)Oh, he's really good with her.

4
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:10,120
(Bernadette:)Yeah, he has a gift.

5
00:00:10,124 --> 00:00:12,694
(Howard:)What's the matter?

6
00:00:12,693 --> 00:00:15,763
(Bernadette:)Nothing,
these are happy tears.

7
00:00:15,763 --> 00:00:17,793
(Sheldon:)Oh, good.

8
00:00:17,798 --> 00:00:19,728
(Bernadette:)No they're not,
you bozo!

9
00:00:21,902 --> 00:00:26,442
(Bernadette:)How come Stuart can get her
to stop crying, but I can't?

10
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:28,710
(Howard:)I mean, it's Stuart.

11
00:00:28,709 --> 00:00:33,579
(Howard:)Maybe she's playing possum
until he goes away.

12
00:00:33,581 --> 00:00:35,981
(Bernadette:)Not funny.

13
00:00:35,983 --> 00:00:39,083
(Raj:)She's tired, that was funny.

14
00:00:40,187 --> 00:00:43,327
(Bernadette:)Everyone's a better mom
than me.

15
00:00:43,324 --> 00:00:45,554
(Raj:)Oh, don't take it so personally,

16
00:00:45,559 --> 00:00:48,859
(Raj:)maybe your baby's just a jerk.

17
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:55,700
(Sheldon:)Wait, so how does
the story end?

